     A                                      B is optionally entered and the "EN-
     A                                      TER" key'
     A                                 17  3'is pressed.  Fields C thru E will -
     A                                      then appear on a secondary screen.'
     A                                 18  4'C - Current Clock Card Number iden-
     A                                      tified in system is displayed here.'
     A                                 19  4'D - User Name (Current Clock Card)-
     A                                       is displayed here.'
     A                                 20  4'E - If user is in progress on a wo-
     A                                      rkorder, the workorder number will -
     A                                      appear'
     A                                 21  8'here, otherwise the word "UNASSIGN-
     A                                      ED" will appear.'
