     A                                      f2" key is pressed, the screen will-
     A                                       change to'
     A                                 14  1'allow entry of an optional closing-
     A                                       comment to the workorder as well a-
     A                                      s promptin'
     A                                 15  1'for valid sub-systems if the failu-
     A                                      re code is not known or if it is en-
     A                                      tered'
     A                                 16  1'incorrectly.'
     A                                 18  1'If the "f2" key is pressed, the cu-
     A                                      rrent Craftsman will be placed Inac-
     A                                      tive from'
     A                                 19  1'this workorder and if there are no-
     A                                       other craftsmen IP on the workorde-
     A                                      r, it will'
     A                                 20  1'be closed (workorder status change-
     A                                      d to CW).'
