     A                                      workorder'
     A                                 12  1'in one of four ways.'
     A                                 13  3'A - Leave workorder not completed.-
     A                                        (An "X" is input)'
     A                                 14  3'B - Leave workorder, New Skill (an-
     A                                      other Craft) Required.  (New Skill -
     A                                      is input'
     A                                 15  3'C - Leave workorder, required part-
     A                                      s not available.  NOTE:  In this ca-
     A                                      se, the'
     A                                 16  7'workorder is placed in "HM" status-
     A                                       - hold for material.  (An "X" is i-
     A                                      nput'
     A                                 17  3'D - Leave to start work on another-
     A                                       workorder.  (New workorder number -
     A                                      is input'
     A                                 19  1'If the "f8" key is pressed, the cu-
     A                                      rrent Craftsman will be placed Inac-
     A                                      tive from'
     A                                 20  1'current workorder and a screen wil-
     A                                      l appear allowing input of a commen-
     A                                      t to the'
     A                                 21  1'workorder describing work done and-
     A                                      /or reason for leaving.  If option -
     A                                      A, B, or C'
     A                                 22  1'is selected, the comment is requir-
     A                                      ed.'
