     A                                  1  7'==================================-
     A                                      ==================================='
     A                                  2  7':  C R A F T S M A N   F U N C T I-
     A                                       O N S   H E L P   S C R E E N S  :'
     A                                  3  7'==================================-
     A                                      ==================================='
     A                                  5 16'Selection of the "f1" key, Workord-
     A                                      er Queue Backlog:'
     A                                  7  1'**********************************-
     A                                      ***********************************-
     A                                      **********'
     A                                  8  5'f1   -   Automatic Queue Backlog I-
     A                                      nquiry'
     A                                  9  1'**********************************-
     A                                      ***********************************-
     A                                      **********'
     A                                 11  1'The Automatic Queue Backlog will d-
     A                                      isplay the workorder queue in desce-
     A                                      nding orde'
     A                                 12  1'based on the Queue Factor, or rela-
     A                                      tive priority, of the workorder.  F-
     A                                      or Zone'
     A                                 13  1'sign-ons, the program will display-
     A                                       workorders in that zone only.  For-
     A                                       central'
     A                                 14  1'shop locations, the program can be-
     A                                       set to display all workorders for -
     A                                      a given'
     A                                 15  1'craft.  The first time the program-
     A                                       is executed per sign-on, it will r-
     A                                      equire tha'
     A                                 16  1'a zone (or craft) be identified, t-
     A                                      hereafter, it will use the same inf-
     A                                      ormation'
     A                                 17  1'unless a change is requested by th-
     A                                      e craftsman.  While the program is -
     A                                      running,'
     A                                 18  1'the display will automatically ref-
     A                                      resh and update itself every 2 minu-
     A                                      tes,'
     A                                 19  1'keeping the information current to-
     A                                       the shop situation.  If an "X" is -
     A                                      typed on'
     A                                 20  1'any workorder number "ENTER" is pr-
     A                                      essed, the workorder will be displa-
     A                                      yed.'
     A                                 21  1'NOTE:  If a zone has already been -
     A                                      identified by the "f6" Open/Active -
     A                                      Inquiry'
     A                                 22  1'program, the same zone will defaul-
     A                                      t to this program.'
     A                                 23 74'HELP 6'
     A  95                             24  1'                    F3=EXIT HELP  -
     A                                            F24=More keys'
     A            COMMANDLIN    79A  O 24  1
     A  96                                  OVRDTA
     A                                      DFT('F2=NEXT SCREEN      F8=PREVIOU-
     A                                      S SCREEN  F5=HELP MENU        F24=M-
     A                                      ore keys')
     A  99        MESSAGELIN    78   M
     A  99                                  OVRDTA
     A          R HELP62
     A*%%TS  DD  19931123  135739  T881S32     REL-V2R2M0  5733-073
     A  96                                  CF24
