     A                                  1  7'==================================-
     A                                      ==================================='
     A                                  2  7':  C R A F T S M A N   F U N C T I-
     A                                       O N S   H E L P   S C R E E N S  :'
     A                                  3  7'==================================-
     A                                      ==================================='
     A                                  5 19'Selection of the "f2" key, Message-
     A                                       Functions:'
     A                                  7  1'**********************************-
     A                                      ***********************************-
     A                                      **********'
     A                                  8  5'f2   -   Send Message to Craftsman-
     A                                       or Workorder'
     A                                  9  1'**********************************-
     A                                      ***********************************-
     A                                      **********'
     A                                 11  1'The Message Functions allow the cr-
     A                                      aftsman to send a message to anothe-
     A                                      r craftsma'
     A                                 12  1'or to write a permanent message to-
     A                                       a workorder.  Either the Clock Car-
     A                                      d (Badge)'
     A                                 13  1'number of the receiving craftsman -
     A                                      or the workorder number must be ent-
     A                                      ered, then'
     A                                 14  1'the message is typed as desired.  -
     A                                      If the message is to be printed, en-
     A                                      ter any'
     A                                 15  1'character in the print field and t-
     A                                      he message will hardcopy to the rec-
     A                                      eiving'
     A                                 16  1'craftsman''s zone printer, or the -
     A                                      zone printer designated on the work-
     A                                      order.'
     A                                 18  1'NOTE:  Messages sent to craftsmen -
     A                                      which are printed are not sent to a-
     A                                       terminal.'
     A                                 19  8'In other words, the message will e-
     A                                      xist as hardcopy but will not appea-
     A                                      r'
     A                                 20  8'when the receiving craftsman signs-
     A                                      -on to a terminal.'
     A                                 23 74'HELP 6'
     A  95                             24  1'                    F3=EXIT HELP  -
     A                                            F24=More keys'
     A            COMMANDLIN    79A  O 24  1
     A  96                                  OVRDTA
     A                                      DFT('F2=NEXT SCREEN      F8=PREVIOU-
     A                                      S SCREEN  F5=HELP MENU        F24=M-
     A                                      ore keys')
     A  99        MESSAGELIN    78   M
     A  99                                  OVRDTA
     A          R HELP63
     A*%%TS  DD  19931123  135739  T881S32     REL-V2R2M0  5733-073
     A  96                                  CF24
     A                                      PUTOVR
