     A                                  1  7'==================================-
     A                                      ==================================='
     A                                  2  7':  C R A F T S M A N   F U N C T I-
     A                                       O N S   H E L P   S C R E E N S  :'
     A                                  3  7'==================================-
     A                                      ==================================='
     A                                  5 16'Selection of the "f8" key, Equipme-
     A                                      nt Reference File:'
     A                                  7  1'**********************************-
     A                                      ***********************************-
     A                                      **********'
     A                                  8  5'f8   -   Equipment Reference Inqui-
     A                                      ry'
     A                                  9  1'**********************************-
     A                                      ***********************************-
     A                                      **********'
     A                                 11  1'The Equipment Reference Inquiry al-
     A                                      lows the craftsman access to inform-
     A                                      ation'
     A                                 12  1'stored by local equipment and subs-
     A                                      ystem numbers for equipment in the -
     A                                      plant.'
     A                                 13  1'The engineering department at each-
     A                                       plant can enter various history, r-
     A                                      emarks,'
     A                                 14  1'adjustments, settings, etc. for in-
     A                                      dividual subsystems as well as spar-
     A                                      e parts'
     A                                 15  1'lists and appropriate drawing list-
     A                                      s.  All are available to the crafts-
     A                                      man'
     A                                 16  1'through this program.'
     A                                 17  1'If the craftsman is in-progress (I-
     A                                      P) on a workorder, the equipment na-
     A                                      med on the'
     A                                 18  1'workorder will default to the entr-
     A                                      y field of the inquiry.  The crafts-
     A                                      man may'
     A                                 19  1'enter another number over this if -
     A                                      desired.'
     A                                 20  1'Also, parts may be ordered from th-
     A                                      e storeroom directly from the spare-
     A                                       parts'
     A                                 21  1'portion of this program.'
     A                                 23 74'HELP 6'
     A  95                             24  1'                    F3=EXIT HELP  -
     A                                            F24=More keys'
     A            COMMANDLIN    79A  O 24  1
     A  96                                  OVRDTA
     A                                      DFT('F2=NEXT SCREEN      F8=PREVIOU-
     A                                      S SCREEN  F5=HELP MENU        F24=M-
     A                                      ore keys')
