     A                                      ==================================='
     A                                  5 18'Selection of the "f4" key, Storero-
     A                                      om Functions:'
     A                                  7  1'**********************************-
     A                                      ***********************************-
     A                                      **********'
     A                                  8  5'f4   -   Storeroom Withdrawal/Inqu-
     A                                      iry'
     A                                  9  1'**********************************-
     A                                      ***********************************-
     A                                      **********'
     A                                 11  1'The Storeroom Functions allow the -
     A                                      craftsman to withdraw materials dir-
     A                                      ectly from'
     A                                 12  1'the storeroom and to inquire inven-
     A                                      tory levels for various parts.'
     A                                 13  1'If the craftsman is in-progress (I-
     A                                      P) on a workorder, the clock card n-
     A                                      umber and'
     A                                 14  1'workorder number will carry into t-
     A                                      he withdrawal screen so that the on-
     A                                      ly fields'
     A                                 15  1'required for the craftsman to fill-
     A                                       in is the part numbers and the qua-
     A                                      ntity.'
     A                                 23 74'HELP 6'
     A  95                             24  1'                    F3=EXIT HELP  -
