     A                                  6  1'**********************************-
     A                                      ***********************************-
     A                                      **********'
     A                                  7  5'f6   -   Workorder Inquiry Program-
     A                                      s'
     A                                  8  1'**********************************-
     A                                      ***********************************-
     A                                      **********'
     A                                  9  1'The "f6" key will display another -
     A                                      menu to select from workorder inqui-
     A                                      ries:'
     A                                 11  5'f1   -   Open/Active (OO/IP) Worko-
     A                                      rder Inquiry'
     A                                 13  5'f2   -   Equipment Workorder Histo-
     A                                      ry Inquiry'
     A                                 15  1'The Open/Active inquiry will displ-
     A                                      ay lists of all verbal workorders i-
     A                                      n a zone'
     A                                 16  1'which are currently in open (OO) o-
     A                                      r active (IP) status.  The first ti-
     A                                      me the'
     A                                 17  1'program is executed per sign-on, i-
     A                                      t will require that a zone be ident-
     A                                      ified,'
     A                                 18  1'thereafter, it will use the same i-
     A                                      nformation unless a change is reque-
     A                                      sted by'
     A                                 19  1'the craftsman.'
     A                                 20  1'The Equipment History Inquiry will-
     A                                       list all workorders in all except -
     A                                      the "H"'
     A                                 21  1'statuses which have been written a-
     A                                      gainst a specific piece of equipmen-
     A                                      t.'
     A                                 22  1'NOTE:  If a zone has already been -
     A                                      identified by the "f1" Automatic Qu-
     A                                      eue Backlo'
     A                                 23  1'program, the same zone will defaul-
     A                                      t to the OO/IP inquiry.            -
