     A                                  9  1'**********************************-
     A                                      ***********************************-
     A                                      **********'
     A                                 11  1'If the "f7" key is pressed, the cu-
     A                                      rrent craftsman identified by the s-
     A                                      ystem is'
     A                                 12  1'cleared from the program and the s-
     A                                      creen is reset to the initial scree-
     A                                      n to allow'
     A                                 13  1'a new craftsman to enter the syste-
     A                                      m.'
     A                                 15  1'NOTE:  This function will occur au-
     A                                      tomatically after 60 seconds if the-
     A                                      re is no'
     A                                 16  8'activity on the terminal.'
